It is Sunday.
I wake up late.
My flat is very quiet.
I look out the window.
The street is completely empty.
It is January and it is cold.
A coffee is important now.
I eat a bread roll with it.
My breakfast is delicious.
I look at the mobile phone.
What time is it in Mexico?
It is three o'clock in the night.
My family is still sleeping.
Who is awake there now?
Nobody is awake.
So I still have a few hours.
The video call is not until the afternoon.
That is a quiet morning.
